sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant FE as Next.js (Vercel)
    participant API as FastAPI (Render)
    participant IDX as Index/Parser
    participant VDB as Chroma
    participant LLM as LLM Provider

    Dev->>FE: Ask question about repository
    FE->>API: POST /chat
    API->>IDX: Build query variants
    API->>VDB: Hybrid retrieve candidates
    API->>LLM: Re-rank + answer with context
    LLM-->>API: Grounded response
    API-->>FE: Answer + citations
    FE-->>Dev: Render response and sources

